      "index.html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tidewater – Port Aird tide times</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Community-run tide tables and boating-safety notes for Port Aird harbour.\">\n<style>\n:root{\n  --paper:#dfe8e6; --ink:#10303a; --deep:#0b2530; --sea:#8fb9bd; --buoy:#d2412b; --white:#f7faf9; --muted:#47626a;\n  --serif:\"Iowan Old Style\",\"Palatino Linotype\",Palatino,\"Book Antiqua\",Georgia,serif;\n  --sans:system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\nbody{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:1.0625rem/1.55 var(--sans)}\na{color:inherit}\n:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--buoy);outline-offset:3px}\n.wrap{max-width:62rem;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.25rem}\nheader.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:1rem 0}\n.brand{font:700 1.35rem var(--serif);text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:.01em}\n.top a.small{font-size:.95rem}\n.hero{background:var(--deep);color:var(--white);padding:1.5rem 0 2.5rem}\n.hero .wrap{display:grid;gap:1.5rem}\nh1{font:700 clamp(2.4rem,9vw,4.6rem)/1.02 var(--serif);margin:0;letter-spacing:-.01em;max-width:14ch}\n.hero p.lead{margin:0;max-width:34ch;color:#c5dadb;font-size:1.15rem}\n.cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--buoy);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:1.2rem;padding:1.05rem 1.6rem;border-radius:.4rem;text-decoration:none;min-height:3.25rem}\n.cta:hover{background:#b9351f}\n.chart{background:#0f3340;border:1px solid #27505e;border-radius:.5rem;padding:1rem 1rem .5rem}\n.chart .now{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.25rem .75rem;margin-bottom:.25rem}\n.chart .now strong{font:700 2.2rem var(--serif)}\n.chart .now span{color:#9fc3c6;font-size:.95rem}\nsvg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}\n.chart .cap{font-size:.85rem;color:#9fc3c6;margin:.25rem 0 .5rem}\n@media(min-width:56rem){.hero .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr 1.25fr;align-items:end;gap:3rem}.hero{padding-bottom:3.5rem}}\nsection{padding:3rem 0}\nh2{font:700 clamp(1.7rem,5vw,2.4rem)/1.1 var(--serif);margin:0 0 1rem}\n.times{display:grid;gap:0;border-top:2px solid var(--ink);margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}\n.times li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:5.5rem 1fr auto;gap:.75rem;align-items:baseline;padding:.8rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #a9bfbd}\n.times .t{font:700 1.4rem var(--serif);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.times .h{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-weight:600}\n.times .k{color:var(--muted)}\n.two{display:grid;gap:2rem}\n@media(min-width:48rem){.two{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4rem}}\n.safety{background:var(--white)}\n.safety ul{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}\n.safety li{padding:.9rem 0 .9rem 1.1rem;border-left:4px solid var(--sea);margin-bottom:.75rem}\n.safety li.warn{border-color:var(--buoy)}\n.safety b{display:block}\np{max-width:60ch}\nfooter{background:var(--deep);color:#b5cfd1;padding:2rem 0;font-size:.95rem}\nfooter p{margin:.25rem 0}\n.hero h1,.chart .curve{animation:rise 1.6s ease-out both}\n.chart .dot{animation:pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite}\n@keyframes rise{from{opacity:.2}to{opacity:1}}\n@keyframes pulse{50%{r:11;opacity:.55}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"hero\">\n <div class=\"wrap\">\n  <header class=\"top\" style=\"grid-column:1/-1\">\n   <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#\">Tidewater</a>\n   <a class=\"small\" href=\"#safety\">Safety notes</a>\n  </header>\n  <div>\n   <h1>Know the water before you cast off.</h1>\n   <p class=\"lead\" style=\"margin:1rem 0 1.5rem\">Tide times for Port Aird harbour, kept by people who launch from the same slip you do.</p>\n   <a class=\"cta\" href=\"#today\">See today's tides</a>\n  </div>\n  <figure class=\"chart\" style=\"margin:0\" aria-label=\"Sample tide curve for Port Aird: high water 06:42 at 4.8 metres, low water 12:55 at 0.9 metres, high water 19:08 at 5.1 metres\">\n   <div class=\"now\"><strong>Rising, 3.2 m</strong><span>Example chart</span></div>\n   <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 190\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <g stroke=\"#27505e\" stroke-width=\"1\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"40\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"90\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"140\"/></g>\n    <path class=\"curve\" d=\"M0 118 C40 60,70 28,100 28 S160 150,205 152 S270 24,310 24 S370 110,400 130 L400 190 L0 190Z\" fill=\"#1d5663\" opacity=\".75\"/>\n    <path class=\"curve\" d=\"M0 118 C40 60,70 28,100 28 S160 150,205 152 S270 24,310 24 S370 110,400 130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8fd0d4\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n    <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#d2412b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n    <circle class=\"dot\" cx=\"150\" cy=\"106\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#d2412b\"/>\n    <g fill=\"#c5dadb\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\"><text x=\"78\" y=\"18\">High 06:42</text><text x=\"178\" y=\"174\">Low 12:55</text><text x=\"288\" y=\"14\">High 19:08</text></g>\n   </svg>\n   <p class=\"cap\">Heights in metres above chart datum.</p>\n  </figure>\n </div>\n</div>\n\n<main>\n<section id=\"today\">\n <div class=\"wrap two\">\n  <div>\n   <h2>Today at Port Aird</h2>\n   <p>High and low water, with the height at each. Times are local. The harbour bar is only safe to cross on a rising tide above 2.5 metres.</p>\n  </div>\n  <ul class=\"times\" aria-label=\"Example tide times\">\n   <li><span class=\"t\">06:42</span><span class=\"h\">High water</span><span class=\"k\">4.8 m</span></li>\n   <li><span class=\"t\">12:55</span><span class=\"h\">Low water</span><span class=\"k\">0.9 m</span></li>\n   <li><span class=\"t\">19:08</span><span class=\"h\">High water</span><span class=\"k\">5.1 m</span></li>\n   <li><span class=\"t\">01:20</span><span class=\"h\">Low water, tomorrow</span><span class=\"k\">0.8 m</span></li>\n  </ul>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"safety\" id=\"safety\">\n <div class=\"wrap two\">\n  <div>\n   <h2>Notes from the harbour</h2>\n   <p>Short, dated updates from the volunteers who watch the harbour. Each one says when it was written and who wrote it.</p>\n  </div>\n  <ul>\n   <li class=\"warn\"><b>Slip is slick below half tide</b>Weed on the lower third. Wear boots with grip.</li>\n   <li><b>Mooring buoys 4 to 7 re-laid</b>Check your pick-up line is long enough at high water.</li>\n   <li><b>Lifejacket swap shelf</b>Spare lifejackets are in the blue box by the harbour office. Take one, return it.</li>\n  </ul>\n </div>\n</section>\n\n<section>\n <div class=\"wrap two\">\n  <div>\n   <h2>Built for the dock</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <p>Big numbers, high contrast, and no sign-up. It loads on a weak signal and works in sun glare with wet hands.</p>\n   <p>Tidewater is run by volunteers and costs nothing to use. Predictions come from local gauge records; always look at the water as well.</p>\n   <p><a class=\"cta\" href=\"#today\">See today's tides</a></p>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<footer><div class=\"wrap\"><p>Tidewater, a community project for Port Aird.</p><p>In an emergency call 999 and ask for the Coastguard.</p></div></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
